"day":null,"month":null,"year":2027},"status":"NOT_YET_RELEASED","studios":[{"animation":true,"id":7263,"name":"CompTown"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"One day, while rushing to a piano lesson, a girl named Saki collides with someone on the street. As Saki collects herself, the stranger picks up the sheet music Saki dropped, hands it to Saki together with a band-aid, and continues on her way—all without saying a word. Saki is left wondering about the identity of the tall, lovely stranger, only to discover the next day that she is one of her classmates at her new high school. The girl’s name is Kanon, and though she is hearing impaired, she refuses any kind of support or “special treatment” from her teachers or classmates. Over the course of the year, Saki slowly grows closer to Kanon and begins to chip away at her cold exterior.\n\n(Source: Kodansha USA)"},"tags":[{"name":"Yuri","rank":94,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Disability","rank":93,"spoiler":false},{"name":"LGBTQ+ Themes","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Classical Music","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bullying","rank":53,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Amayo no Tsuki","english":null,"native":"雨夜の月","romaji":"Amayo no Tsuki","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"雨夜之月"}]},"trailer":{"id":"Q-W1E8Y9Jv0","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Q-W1E8Y9Jv0/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}